# Copy to system.env (git-ignored). Read by the docker build and push scripts
# (make build-server, make dockerpush-provider, make dockerpush-server, and the
# deploy-* targets that run them). A value set in the environment wins over
# the value in this file.
#
# Where the provider images (aipiary-worker, aipiary-api and the four redis
# images aipiary-rmain, -rdata, -rcache, -rbody) are pushed. Images go to
# ${PROVIDER_REGISTRY}/aipiary-<name>:<tag> and :latest. Volunteers pull them,
# so this registry has to be public. Examples: "yourdockerhubuser" (Docker
# Hub), "ghcr.io/youruser", "yourregistry.azurecr.io".
PROVIDER_REGISTRY=
# Where the server images (aipiary-server-api and aipiary-server-rserver) are
# pushed, as ${SERVER_REGISTRY}/aipiary-server-<name>:<tag>. make build-server
# also writes this prefix into the generated docker-compose.server.yml.
SERVER_REGISTRY=
# Credentials for docker login to the registries above. Leave them empty if
# you are already logged in (e.g., through docker login or az acr login).
DOCKER_USER=
DOCKER_TOKEN=
